    "description": "Calling upon the Queen of the Night Skies, a sudden moonlit night falls in a 30-ft emanation, casting twilight. Evil foes take -1 on attacks, damage, saves, and skills (Will negates). You and allies gain +1 sacred AC, attacks, and Reflex, +10 ft speed, 60 ft darkvision, and +2 flanking bonus. Each ally (excluding caster) retaliates with 1d8 force damage once per round when struck by an adjacent foe. Each round on your turn, choose one Battle Cadence benefit: (A) Spectral Assault (iterative force strike at BAB + Wis dealing 1d8 + 1 per 3 CL max +5), (B) Flurry of Steel (+1 haste full attack), or (C) Divine Celerity (Quicken Cleric spells of 0-1st level, scaling to 4th at CL 18).",
